Sentence|Translation
Jau vi ina bunamama|I want a tip
Nua è la bunamama?|Where is the tip?
La tschaina n'è betg sin in taglier!|The dinner is not on a plate!
La tschaina è en ina scadiola|The dinner is in a cup
Jau vuless ina scadiola vin|I would like a glass of wine
Jau mangiel cun ina savetscha e in cunti|I eat with a knife and a fork
Mangevas ti ina savetscha?|Did you eat a fork?
Nus faschevan in cunti|We made a knife
Jau mangeva la nusch cun ina savetscha|I ate the nut with a fork
La nusch è gronda|The nut is big
Jau vuless in'erva cun la tschaina|I would like a herb with the dinner
È l'erva en ina salata?|Is the herb in a salad?
La salata e la sosa da salata|The salad and the salad dressing
Jau vi ina sosa da salata|I want a salad dressing
Mangevas ti la charn-vadi?|Did you eat the veal?
Vuls ti la charn vadi u la ligiongia?|Do you want the veal or the sausage?
La tschaina è ligiongia cun grut asch|The dinner is sausage with sauerkraut
È la scadiola aua sin il talgier?|Is the glass of water on the plate?